# Local scratch / session tooling (Codebase De-Bloat Sprint 1, 2026-08-11) -- these are
# workspace-local helper scripts and scratch output, never product code; keep them out of git so
# they can't be accidentally tracked via a future `git add -A`.
/scratchpad/
/upload.sh
/paxel-upload.sh

# Evidence Storage Policy (docs/readiness/EVIDENCE_STORAGE_POLICY_2026_08_12.md): local-only home
# for evidence artifacts that must never enter this public repo's git history (unmasked personal
# contact info, signed documents naming third parties, etc). Indexed by description, never by
# content, in docs/readiness/EVIDENCE_INDEX_2026_08_12.md -- keep this folder out of git so a
# future `git add -A` can never accidentally track anything inside it.
/evidence-private/

